Most importanat reqirementrs:
Log in -> filer -> search -> search somewhere else
Log in -> fail to find results
Not log in -> fail to get results

- Title: General search redo test
  - test ID: general_search_redo
  - preconditions:
      - launch the application
      - log in by providing a token
  - test steps:
      - navigate to the map tab
      - set the filters to hotel
      - click on the location (bigger city)
      - click on the different location (also bigger city)
  - expected result:
      - hotels in the area are shown on the second try
  - postconditions:
      - restore the default filter settings
      - log out

- Title: General no results test
  - test ID: general_no_results
  - preconditions:
      - launch the application
      - log in by providing a token
  - test steps:
      - navigate to the map tab
      - disable all filters
      - click in the middle of the ocean
  - expected result:
      - message "No results found. Click on map to select different location." is displayed.
  - postconditions:
      - restore the default filter settings
      - log out

- Title: General not logged fail
  - test ID: general_not_logged_fail
  - preconditions:
      - launch the application
  - test steps:
      - navigate to the map tab
      - disable all filters
      - click anywhere on the map
  - expected result:
      - message "Failed to fetch locations. You may not be logged in." is displayed
  - postconditions:
      - restore the default filter settings
